Subject: [PATCH 22/31] qtest: cover NCR53C710 SCRIPTS and message handling

Exercise transfer-control NOPs and conditional/unconditional transfers,
interrupt status acknowledgement, both SIGP timing cases, negotiation reject
messages and the final ACK transition through the HPPA LASI register window.
Poison destinations report failures without unbounded interpreter loops.


